<view class="page">
  <view class="top-bar">
    <view class="back-btn" bindtap="goBack">‹</view>
    <text class="top-bar-title">联系人标签</text>
  </view>

  <view class="content">
    <view class="section-title">我的标签（长按可删除）</view>

    <view class="tag-list">
      <view
        wx:for="{{tags}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="tag-chip"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        data-name="{{item.name}}"
        bindlongpress="deleteTag"
      >
        {{item.name}}
      </view>
      <view class="tag-chip add-tag" bindtap="addTag">+ 新建标签</view>
    </view>

    <view class="tip" wx:if="{{!loading && tags.length === 0}}">
      还没有标签，点「+ 新建标签」创建，比如「投资人」「潜在客户」
    </view>
    <view class="tip" wx:if="{{tags.length > 0}}">
      在联系人详情页可以给对方打上这些标签，方便分类管理
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
